summary.label:
Keep track of new English words and phrases you encounter them.

With Lexical you can:
- Keep a record of new words and phrases as you encounter them;
- Harvest English words from websites;
- Organise  your favourite words into lists;
- Look up words in the built-in dictionary on your iOS device; and
- Learn the standard pronunciations of words by listening to native speakers pronounce them.

Lexical will make a great tool for those learning or teaching the English language or for those who wish to broaden their English vocabulary.
